613
00:22:44,700 --> 00:22:45,700
Oh, I can't do it.

614
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:47,200
(Oom can't handle this one.) Me neither.

615
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:49,800
(Oom can't handle this one.) No, no, guys. It's really so much fun.

616
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:51,500
This is the most fun thing here.

617
00:22:51,500 --> 00:22:53,767
- My heart's pounding. Okay... - Mine too.

618
00:22:53,800 --> 00:22:54,633
Love you.

619
