633
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:21,767
- They might still not come down. - They might not come down yet.

634
00:23:21,767 --> 00:23:22,500
My heart's racing.

635
00:23:22,500 --> 00:23:24,833
- I can't handle heights. - My hands are shaking.

636
00:23:24,833 --> 00:23:26,833
You go ahead. I want to see.

637
