You're giving up?

665
00:24:17,467 --> 00:24:18,433
I can't do it!

666
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:22,200
Ahh!

667
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,067
I can't!

668
00:24:23,067 --> 00:24:26,033
Even this one scared me! How can I handle that one?

669
00:24:26,333 --> 00:24:28,167
Even this one scared me!

670
00:24:28,967 --> 00:24:30,300
Oh my God, it's so steep.

671
00:24:30,300 --> 00:24:31,300
