675
00:24:37,900 --> 00:24:38,767
- One, two... - Go!

676
00:24:38,833 --> 00:24:39,767
Go!

677
00:24:42,900 --> 00:24:43,700
See?

678
00:24:44,767 --> 00:24:46,333
See? You couldn't handle it.

679
