Look at Tan's face.

680
00:24:47,833 --> 00:24:48,800
Tan!

681
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:51,667
I've never been on a scarier slide in my life!

682
00:24:51,667 --> 00:24:52,533
- Really? - It's steep.

683
00:24:52,533 --> 00:24:55,133
- Tan's face confirmed my fear. - Then let's go again. Come!

684
00:24:55,167 --> 00:24:55,733
Again?

685
