It goes down like this.

691
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:06,400
We were acting all tough, hyping them up.

692
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:08,833
- We have to go down, right? Okay. - We have to go down.

693
00:25:09,900 --> 00:25:11,900
Ahh, oh my God!

694
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:13,667
Hey!

695
00:25:13,800 --> 00:25:17,300
But it's scary because you drop down like this.

696
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:19,300
Now I get it. Because I wasn't

697
00:25:19,300 --> 00:25:20,567
- leaning back. - Yes.

698
00:25:20,567 --> 00:25:22,867
When you sit upright, it feels like you're gonna face-plant.

699
00:25:22,867 --> 00:25:23,967
Gotta lean back a little.

700
00:25:24,933 --> 00:25:26,800
(Cute shirt) That's a cute shirt.

701
00:25:27,167 --> 00:25:28,033
What about me?

702
00:25:28,033 --> 00:25:30,000
(Is she cute too?) Yeah, what about her?

703
00:25:30,267 --> 00:25:31,933
She's cute too. She's cute too.

704
00:25:33,833 --> 00:25:34,900
Can I have a look?

705
00:25:34,933 --> 00:25:35,833
No, you can't!

706
00:25:35,833 --> 00:25:36,967
Can I have a look?

707
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:40,900
