716
00:25:56,867 --> 00:25:58,100
Next, we'll be...

717
00:25:58,533 --> 00:25:59,400
cowboys!

718
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:00,267
Okay, cowboys.

719
00:26:00,267 --> 00:26:01,267
This is...

720
00:26:08,267 --> 00:26:09,300
I'm not ready.

721
00:26:09,300 --> 00:26:10,767
Let whoever can do it go first.

722
00:26:10,767 --> 00:26:12,767
Yeah, let whoever can do it go first.

723
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:14,800
Whoa!

724
00:26:14,800 --> 00:26:17,000
