725
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:17,967
A little bouncy.

726
00:26:17,967 --> 00:26:18,967
It's bouncy.

727
00:26:22,633 --> 00:26:23,333
Ready?

728
00:26:23,333 --> 00:26:25,533
This is actually quite scary.

729
00:26:25,533 --> 00:26:27,167
But don't be scared, Tan.

730
00:26:27,967 --> 00:26:29,967
