731
00:26:30,533 --> 00:26:32,000
It's okay. I'll copy them.

732
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,367
Yeah, just copy them.

733
00:26:33,367 --> 00:26:34,733
Here's a little trick.

734
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,367
Copy the person before you.

735
00:26:36,367 --> 00:26:40,000
This game requires you to use all your senses.

736
00:26:42,100 --> 00:26:44,533
Are all the obstacles up there like this?

737
