741
00:27:06,467 --> 00:27:08,733
(Lena and Miu get through with ease)

742
00:27:08,733 --> 00:27:09,967
Be careful there.

743
00:27:11,167 --> 00:27:13,100
Tense your abs, so you'll get...

744
00:27:13,100 --> 00:27:15,000
