745
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:16,267
Are you having fun?

746
00:27:16,267 --> 00:27:17,200
I am.

747
00:27:17,733 --> 00:27:19,700
(These two are always flirting.) It's fun when we do it together.

748
00:27:19,700 --> 00:27:20,500
Right?

749
00:27:27,367 --> 00:27:28,233
Oh!

750
00:27:28,233 --> 00:27:29,633
