751
00:27:29,633 --> 00:27:31,600
Yay! This is so much fun!

752
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:32,767
Last one, right?

753
00:27:33,267 --> 00:27:34,833
Back where we started.

754
00:27:36,900 --> 00:27:39,200
What job are we pretending to do now?

755
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:39,967
Your job?

756
00:27:40,500 --> 00:27:41,533
Spider-Man.

757
00:27:41,567 --> 00:27:42,433
Spider-Man.

758
00:27:42,433 --> 00:27:43,333
Whoo!

759
