766
00:27:58,100 --> 00:28:02,567
The team that completes the mission in the shortest time wins.

767
00:28:02,567 --> 00:28:06,400
You have to decide who's on the first, second, and third floors.

768
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,833
Do we go one team at a time?

769
00:28:07,833 --> 00:28:10,200
Yes, since it only takes one person at a time.

770
00:28:10,233 --> 00:28:11,033
Oh, okay.

771
00:28:11,033 --> 00:28:12,467
- One person per floor? - Yes.

772
00:28:29,300 --> 00:28:30,867
