791
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:48,633
I got this!

792
00:29:52,433 --> 00:29:53,400
I can do it!

793
00:29:58,067 --> 00:29:59,767
The part Yu's on is the hardest.

794
00:29:59,767 --> 00:30:01,767
