795
00:30:01,767 --> 00:30:03,600
But she's made it across.

796
00:30:03,600 --> 00:30:05,167
- Amazing. - Yes. Amazing, right?

797
00:30:05,867 --> 00:30:06,867
- She is. - She is.

798
00:30:06,867 --> 00:30:08,733
It's not hard, guys.

799
00:30:09,967 --> 00:30:11,733
But I'm sweating like crazy.

800
00:30:34,967 --> 00:30:35,767
Go for it!

801
00:30:45,933 --> 00:30:47,267
That was terrifying.

802
00:30:50,367 --> 00:30:51,700
