803
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:54,233
Can we give them easier obstacles?

804
00:30:54,233 --> 00:30:56,000
I don't think Lena can handle these.

805
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,600
But I'm glad I made it through.

806
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,233
Still, I was like, wow...

807
00:30:59,533 --> 00:31:01,667
That was quite challenging.

808
00:31:01,667 --> 00:31:04,433
Honestly, my heart's set on that bull right now.

809
00:31:04,633 --> 00:31:06,467
(She's given up on this mission.) ♪ That bull is mine ♪

810
00:31:06,500 --> 00:31:08,400
(She's given up on this mission.) ♪ I'm gonna ride you ♪

811
00:31:08,400 --> 00:31:09,933
♪ You'll be satisfied ♪

812
00:31:10,867 --> 00:31:11,833
What song is that?

813
00:31:11,833 --> 00:31:13,700
No idea. I made it up.

814
00:31:13,700 --> 00:31:16,167
Oh, it's the song about that thing.

815
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:18,800
We watched them and took out our gear.

816
00:31:19,233 --> 00:31:21,300
Giving up? Are you all giving up?

817
00:31:21,333 --> 00:31:22,733
Let's go ride the bull.

818
00:31:22,867 --> 00:31:24,667
I want to ride the bull now.

819
00:31:24,767 --> 00:31:26,433
We've officially surrendered.

820
00:31:26,433 --> 00:31:27,667
We've surrendered, like,

821
00:31:27,667 --> 00:31:29,633
- for our girls, - Hey, it's just...

822
00:31:29,667 --> 00:31:31,267
of course we can do it.

823
00:31:31,267 --> 00:31:33,900
- By surrendering. - We know everyone's hungry.

824
00:31:34,367 --> 00:31:36,133
When Yu comes down, just applaud.

825
00:31:36,133 --> 00:31:38,267
- I see. - "You win!" We won't do it.

826
00:31:39,367 --> 00:31:40,567
Whoo!

827
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:41,800
Wow, she's amazing.

828
00:31:42,500 --> 00:31:44,600
I can handle a tree, but this is a stand.

829
00:31:44,600 --> 00:31:45,800
It's a straight drop.

830
00:31:46,700 --> 00:31:47,567
Yay!

831
00:31:47,567 --> 00:31:50,067
- Great job! - Great job!

832
00:31:51,300 --> 00:31:52,100
You done?

833
00:31:52,100 --> 00:31:53,333
- You all done? - You won.

834
00:31:53,333 --> 00:31:54,633
You guys won.

835
00:31:54,633 --> 00:31:55,867
- Yeah. - You won.

836
00:31:55,867 --> 00:31:57,700
Because we want to ride the bull.

837
00:31:59,467 --> 00:32:01,567
I got tricked into going up there.

838
00:32:01,567 --> 00:32:04,300
- Great job. - Not just you. I got tricked too.

839
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:06,667
- Great job! - Great job!

840
00:32:06,933 --> 00:32:08,433
Were you scared?

841
00:32:08,700 --> 00:32:10,267
- Was it high? - She's sweating.

842
00:32:10,267 --> 00:32:11,200
Whoo!

843
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:13,133
Bottoms, you guys did amazing.

844
00:32:13,133 --> 00:32:14,533
Yeah, you were incredible.

845
00:32:14,567 --> 00:32:15,533
Great job!

846
00:32:15,533 --> 00:32:17,600
- Yay! - Great job!

847
00:32:17,800 --> 00:32:21,400
No, earlier, all of us, Oom, Tan, and I...

848
00:32:21,667 --> 00:32:23,767
watched from below, and we thought...

849
00:32:23,767 --> 00:32:25,000
we should just give up.

850
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:27,667
No more. We want to ride the bull!

851
00:32:27,667 --> 00:32:29,567
- Yay! - Yay!

852
00:32:29,933 --> 00:32:32,100
At first, when I looked down, I was like,

853
00:32:32,100 --> 00:32:34,000
"Lena shouldn't do this. Don't even try."

854
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:36,567
- "Don't..." - Miu kept giving me this look, like...

855
00:32:36,867 --> 00:32:39,167
She looked like she was about to cry.

856
00:32:39,167 --> 00:32:40,467
- So I thought... - Exactly.

857
00:32:40,467 --> 00:32:43,700
I'm really scared of heights, so I just...

858
00:32:43,700 --> 00:32:44,600
- Yeah. - Maybe not.

859
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:48,267
I feel like today has been filled with so many different emotions.

860
00:32:48,267 --> 00:32:52,167
At first, I was scared, then it was fun, and then, "Oh my God, I can't do this!"

861
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:55,400
But the thing is I probably won't get another chance to do this.

862
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:57,600
So today was a really great day, guys.

863
00:32:57,600 --> 00:32:58,900
It was a great experience.

864
00:32:58,900 --> 00:33:01,967
Yes, without this mission, we probably wouldn't have come here.

865
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:04,700
We wouldn't have realized just how huge this place is.

866
00:33:04,700 --> 00:33:07,267
It was so much fun, and today...

867
00:33:07,333 --> 00:33:08,467
our team won.

868
00:33:08,467 --> 00:33:11,900
We gave it our all because the tops said they wanted to ride the bull.

869
00:33:11,900 --> 00:33:14,433
So we had to do our best for them.

870
00:33:14,433 --> 00:33:17,367
Because the only one on our team brave enough to go down that slide

871
00:33:17,367 --> 00:33:18,233
- is Tan. - Tan.

872
00:33:18,233 --> 00:33:19,167
That's right.

873
00:33:19,167 --> 00:33:20,933
And I had to literally push her.

874
00:33:20,933 --> 00:33:23,133
The thing is I pushed her, like, "Go!"

875
00:33:23,133 --> 00:33:25,500
- True. - But I didn't dare push these two.

876
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:26,767
They'd get upset.

877
00:33:27,467 --> 00:33:29,567
I had to challenge the system a little.

878
00:33:29,567 --> 00:33:31,433
We do whatever the bottoms say.

879
00:33:31,433 --> 00:33:32,100
- Yeah! - Yeah!

880
00:33:32,100 --> 00:33:33,000
You must obey.

881
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:34,500
Then go up there and do it.

882
00:33:34,500 --> 00:33:35,933
I'd rather ride the bull.

883
00:33:36,967 --> 00:33:39,100
Everyone's an MVP. There's no first place.

884
00:33:39,100 --> 00:33:40,567
Because we're all equal.

885
00:33:40,567 --> 00:33:41,800
It depends on the game.

886
00:33:41,800 --> 00:33:45,200
Exactly. I feel like all of us have different skills.

887
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:47,267
Some games require strategy.

888
00:33:47,267 --> 00:33:50,033
Some need strength. Some need defensive skills.

889
00:33:50,033 --> 00:33:52,433
We all have our own unique strengths.

890
00:33:52,433 --> 00:33:54,300
So everyone is the MVP.

891
00:33:54,300 --> 00:33:55,300
That's right, guys.

892
00:33:55,300 --> 00:33:56,500
Come on, go ride the bull.

893
00:33:56,500 --> 00:33:58,033
- Yay! - Let's ride the bull!

894
00:33:58,067 --> 00:33:58,900
Let's go.

895
00:33:59,133 --> 00:34:00,933
- Where is it? - Come check this out.

896
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:02,833
Hey, what's this?

897
00:34:02,867 --> 00:34:04,467
Let's go ride the bull!

898
00:34:04,833 --> 00:34:06,100
Are we doing it now?

899
00:34:12,433 --> 00:34:13,333
That's it!

900
00:34:13,367 --> 00:34:14,667
Yay!

901
00:34:15,699 --> 00:34:17,632
- Didn't even know when it started. - Was it fast?

902
00:34:17,632 --> 00:34:18,667
Oom, you got this!

903
00:34:18,667 --> 00:34:19,400
Was it hard?

904
00:34:28,367 --> 00:34:29,167
Go!

905
00:34:29,233 --> 00:34:31,233
I don't want to do this anymore!

906
00:34:35,867 --> 00:34:37,132
It's dizzying.

907
00:34:37,733 --> 00:34:40,867
The longer you sit on it, the more it starts to...

908
00:34:41,900 --> 00:34:43,833
One, two, three, go!

909
00:34:43,833 --> 00:34:45,400
Hang on! Hang on!

910
00:34:50,266 --> 00:34:53,167
- Gotta squeeze with your knees. - Really? Okay, try it.

911
00:34:58,533 --> 00:34:59,333
See?

912
00:35:03,767 --> 00:35:05,467
- Whoa, whoa! - Why is it gentle?

913
00:35:06,633 --> 00:35:08,033
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

914
00:35:08,033 --> 00:35:08,833
This is hard!

915
00:35:08,833 --> 00:35:10,533
It suddenly got so intense!

916
00:35:12,867 --> 00:35:14,067
That was so much fun!

